WEBVTT

00:10:58.431 --> 00:11:02.620
disappearing around the headlands
12 miles to the south.

00:11:02.644 --> 00:11:06.328
And it really seemed
like my concerns of the previous day

00:11:06.352 --> 00:11:08.278
vanishing.

00:11:08.302 --> 00:11:10.090
And the next day, when I woke up

00:11:10.114 --> 00:11:13.558
in the absence of telephones
and TVs and laptops,

00:11:13.582 --> 00:11:17.711
the days seemed to stretch
for a thousand hours.

00:11:17.735 --> 00:11:21.410
It was really all the freedom
I know when I'm traveling,

00:11:21.434 --> 00:11:26.024
but it also profoundly
felt like coming home.

00:11:26.048 --> 00:11:27.640
And I'm not a religious person,

00:11:27.664 --> 00:11:29.141
so I didn't go to the services.

00:11:29.165 --> 00:11:31.710
I didn't consult the monks for guidance.